 A\n$$\n\nFor a relation $R$ on a set $A,$ we also have the following notations:\n\n- $a\\,R\\,b$ if and only if $(a,b)\\in R$\n\n- $a\\,\\cancel{\\,R\\,}\\,b$ if and only if $(a,b)\\notin R$\n\nIn this case, $R$ is the set of ordered pairs $(x,y)\\in Z\\times Z={Z}^{2}$ such that $3\\,|\\,(x+y).$\n\nTherefore, we can write out $R$ in set-builder notation as follows:\n\n$$\nR={(x,y)\\in {Z}^{2}\\,:\\,3\\,|\\,(x+y)}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-cbaddc60-4ab1-53ea-a39d-217315412f69" "answer-field-40a0cbce-0759-532f-9ab4-aa4e34ae8973" "answer-field-70efa87b-beda-518f-8263-32706eed461b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-cbaddc60-4ab1-53ea-a39d-217315412f69" :answer-field/id #uuid "cbaddc60-4ab1-53ea-a39d-217315412f69" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-3f926afe-f465-5842-9bd3-aad8b7d5dc0e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-31da6476-a086-5047-92af-0b7f80a9e936" "answer-3f926afe-f465-5842-9bd3-aad8b7d5dc0e" "answer-04b7cd61-6d77-5fba-b3b8-52a35ad4aff7" "answer-569f3998-444b-57f3-96fb-62c9f4fff70d" "answer-ac1b4092-e403-5303-8926-e49996d57fe5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-31da6476-a086-5047-92af-0b7f80a9e936" :answer/id #uuid "31da6476-a086-5047-92af-0b7f80a9e936" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x,x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3f926afe-f465-5842-9bd3-aad8b7d5dc0e" :answer/id #uuid "3f926afe-f465-5842-9bd3-aad8b7d5dc0e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x,y)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-04b7cd61-6d77-5fba-b3b8-52a35ad4aff7" :answer/id #uuid "04b7cd61-6d77-5fba-b3b8-52a35ad4aff7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-569f3998-444b-57f3-96fb-62c9f4fff70d" :answer/id #uuid "569f3998-444b-57f3-96fb-62c9f4fff70d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x" :db/ensure [:answer/val