r-322a920c-999f-5ebf-b81b-f1fdff28d7f6" :answer/id #uuid "322a920c-999f-5ebf-b81b-f1fdff28d7f6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3|(x+y)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a2e5a5ab-050e-50ac-994f-b0673a0c7aa4" :answer/id #uuid "a2e5a5ab-050e-50ac-994f-b0673a0c7aa4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3|y" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-55b6da04-b7f1-56ee-be5c-efe8f3b01e06" :answer/id #uuid "55b6da04-b7f1-56ee-be5c-efe8f3b01e06" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+y=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-316794dc-dda4-5deb-8016-1610db41a730" :answer/id #uuid "316794dc-dda4-5deb-8016-1610db41a730" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186205236 :tutorial/content "Recall that a binary relation $R$ on a set $A$ is a subset of the Cartesian product $A\\times A = A^2{:}$\n\n$$\nR\\subseteq A^2\n$$\n\nAdditionally, we have the following notations:\n\n- $x \\: R \\: y$ if and only if $(x,y) \\in R$\n\n- $\\require{cancel}x \\: \\cancel{\\!R\\!} \\: y$ if and only if $(x,y) \\notin R$\n\nRelations can be defined over infinite sets. For example, consider the relation $R$ on $\\mathbb{Z}$ defined by\n\n$$\nx \\: R \\: y \\qquad \\Leftrightarrow \\qquad x \\geq y.\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have $x \\: R \\: y$ if and only if $x \\geq y.$ For this relation, note that\n\n- the symbols $R$ and $\\geq$ are interchangeable, and\n\n- the symbols $\\cancel{\\!R\\!}$ and $\\not\\geq$ (or, equivalently, $\\cancel{\\!R\\!}$ and $\\lt$) are also interchangeable.\n\nFor example:\n\n- $2 \\: R \\: 0$ since $2 \\geq 0$\n\n- $\\require{cancel} 1 \\: \\cancel{\\!R\\!} \\: \\pi$ since $1 \\not\\geq \\pi$\n\n- $0 \\: R \\: 0$ since $0 \\geq 0$\n\nFinally, since $R$ is the set of ordered pairs $(x,y) \\in \\mathbb{Z}^2$ such that $x \\geq y,$ we can write out $R$ in set-builder notation as \n\n$$\nR = \\big\\{ (x,y) \\in \\mathbb{Z}^2 \\: : \\: x \\geq y \\big\\}.\n$$" :db/ensure [:tutorial/validate]} {:db/id 17592186204118 :activity/expected-seconds 480.0 :db/ensure [:activity/validate]}]
